v1.0.55 build 77: align size & generic wheel pickers with smooth deferred slide transition

- sheet_picker.dart: refactored showSheetPicker<T> to use _DeferredWheelPickerSheet<T>.
  Now has the exact same architecture as the date picker: sheet container slides
  up with lightweight placeholder, waits for route animation completion, mounts
  CupertinoPicker inside RepaintBoundary, and executes smooth 250ms easeOut
  SlideTransition via post-frame callback.
- add_costume_sheet.dart: added keyboard unfocus guard before showing 'Ukuran'
  picker, preventing keyboard dismissal physics from competing with sheet popup.
